            <trans-unit id="readiness.sites.intro" resname="readiness.sites.intro">
                <source>These sites name their own configuration in their site settings. A task without its own configuration, run on one of their records, uses it instead of the default; writing in the dialog and field suggestions keep the default. Each row is checked with your access.</source>
